OL,3,GNEWSAPolice vow 'justice' for Baby Ava 
OL,4,Atwo years on                           
OL,6,FPolice say they are determined to get  
OL,7,Fjustice for a baby whose remains were  
OL,8,Ffound two years ago.                   
OL,10,FThe infant, named Ava by Greater       
OL,11,FManchester Police, was discovered by a 
OL,12,Fdog walker near Ashtons Field, in      
OL,13,FLittle Hulton, Salford, on 20 November 
OL,14,F2024.                                  
OL,16,FDespite a long-running investigation   
OL,17,Fand a #50,000 reward put up by the     
OL,18,FGreater Manchester combined authority, 
OL,19,Fdetectives have still not been able to 
OL,20,Fidentify the child's mother.           
