OL,3,GNEWSAPolice vow 'justice' for Baby Ava 
OL,4,Atwo years on                           
OL,6,FGreater Manchester Police (GMP) said   
OL,7,Fits determination to find the answers  
OL,8,F"has never wavered", and that it wanted
OL,9,Fto "secure the justice that Ava        
OL,10,Fdeserves".                             
